. An einem hektischen Tag fällt eine Kollegin aus, doch Floria betreut routiniert alle Patienten. Dann passiert ein verhängnisvoller Fehler, und ein nervenzerrender Wettlauf gegen die Zeit beginnt."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocDHT2uRUo97ojraMIzgnVc9MSI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ocDHT2uRUo97ojraMIzgnVc9MSI.png","language":"it","width":6101,"height":629},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zp9lTAPQadFivmOKLNL36rOwEZe.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zp9lTAPQadFivmOKLNL36rOwEZe.png","language":"en","width":2292,"height":572},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUGyiu0xhktqjiNPtI66u6z8F5Q.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cUGyiu0xhktqjiNPtI66u6z8F5Q.png","language":"de","width":1100,"height":276}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rdPS4URp6joVC0gOW5QF5TVkux.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5rdPS4URp6joVC0gOW5QF5TVkux.jpg","language":"it","width":1143,"height":1714},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnTPQw7v3WlAudA45TaeVKl52jA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jnTPQw7v3WlAudA45TaeVKl52jA.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2X2FZIYdXYNwDbStJhgeoVn0pWH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2X2FZIYdXYNwDbStJhgeoVn0pWH.jpg","language":"en","width":1837,"height":2756},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmW0yWPskfYAxb6ZwMjxDlrWMTP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pmW0yWPskfYAxb6ZwMjxDlrWMTP.jpg","language":"en","width":1837,"height":2756},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7vMlnv14QWjMYr2gVypfIzXxnRQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7vMlnv14QWjMYr2gVypfIzXxnRQ.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":2963},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/